#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:1
msgid "Routing Internals"
msgstr "路由内部机制"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:3
msgid ""
"This page is for contributors changing the routing engine. It explains "
"how a router runs the endpoint it chose, how one router can hand a "
"request to another, and the experimental composition built on that. "
"Nothing here needs configuring to run a gateway; [Routing](routing.md) "
"covers what does."
msgstr ""
"本页写给要修改路由引擎的贡献者。它讲 router 如何执行自己选中的端点、一个 router 如何把请求交给另一个 "
"router，以及在此基础上搭起来的实验性组合。运行网关不需要配置这里的任何东西；需要配置的内容见[路由](routing.md)。"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:8
msgid ""
"The short version: a router picks an endpoint and then calls that "
"endpoint's adapter through a thin wrapper called a *leaf*, which runs "
"exactly the adapter the router picked and nothing else. A *pool* is the "
"other kind of wrapper: it hands the request to a second router that makes"
" its own choice within a limited set of endpoints. Every router in use "
"today executes through leaves; pools are used only by the opt-in "
"composition described at the end."
msgstr ""
"简单来说：router 选定一个端点后，通过一层叫作*叶子*（leaf）的薄包装去调用该端点的 adapter；叶子只执行 router "
"选中的那个 adapter，别的什么都不做。*池*（pool）是另一种包装：它把请求交给第二个 "
"router，由后者在一组有限的端点里自己做选择。目前在用的每个 router 都通过叶子执行；只有文末介绍的、需要显式开启的组合才会用到池。"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:15
msgid "How a request reaches an adapter"
msgstr "请求如何到达 adapter"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:17
msgid ""
"A router owns selection, admission, retries, and feedback. Once it "
"chooses an endpoint, it creates an `EndpointBinding` holding the selected"
" adapter, and a `LeafBackend` calls that adapter. A `TreeBackend` "
"provides a different capability: it delegates to a router inside a "
"declared candidate pool. The wrapped router keeps its own selection and "
"execution flow. See [Leaves, pools, and dispatch instructions](#leaves-"
"pools-and-dispatch-instructions)."
msgstr ""
"router 负责选择、准入、重试与反馈。选定 endpoint 后，它创建一个持有已选 adapter 的 "
"`EndpointBinding`，再由 `LeafBackend` 调用该 adapter。`TreeBackend` "
"提供池委托能力：把请求交给声明候选池内的 router，由被包装的 router 保留自己的选择与执行流程。见[叶子、池与派发指令"
"](#leaves-pools-and-dispatch-instructions)。"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:24
msgid ""
"Startup wiring lives in `apps/backend/serving/servers/bootstrap.py`: it "
"registers routes from the model registry into one process-scoped "
"`FixedRouter`, optionally applies the `RoutingManager`, then builds a "
"`ModelRouterRegistry` over the same route table. Routers for every known "
"model are constructed eagerly at boot, so a bad strategy name or bad "
"`router_params:` is reported at startup rather than on the first request."
" What the registry returns for a model depends on its `router:` field:"
msgstr ""
"启动接线在 `apps/backend/serving/servers/bootstrap.py`：它把模型注册表里的路由注册进一个进程级的 "
"`FixedRouter`，可选地应用 `RoutingManager`，然后在同一张路由表上构建 "
"`ModelRouterRegistry`。每个已知模型的 router 都会在启动时被提前构造，因此策略名写错或 "
"`router_params:` 写错会在启动阶段报出来，而不是等到第一个请求。注册表为一个模型返回什么，取决于它的 `router:` 字段："

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:32
msgid ""
"`routewise` — a `RouteWiseRouter` over the model's full candidate pool, "
"local and cloud alike."
msgstr "`routewise`——一个覆盖该模型完整候选池的 `RouteWiseRouter`，本地与云端一视同仁。"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:34
msgid ""
"`fixed` — the shared `FixedRouter`, unless the model opts in to "
"composition with `router_params.hybrid_composition: true` **and** has "
"both local and cloud candidates. That builds a `HybridRouter` "
"(`serving/servers/hybrid_composition.py`) over a `LocalBackend` and a "
"cloud backend instead. All-local and all-cloud models keep the shared "
"`FixedRouter` even when the option is enabled."
msgstr ""
"`fixed` — 使用共享 `FixedRouter`；只有模型通过 `router_params.hybrid_composition: "
"true` 显式启用组合，**且** 同时具有 local 和 cloud 候选时，才构建 "
"`HybridRouter`（`serving/servers/hybrid_composition.py`），在 `LocalBackend` "
"和 cloud backend 之上组织请求。全部为 local 或全部为 cloud 的模型，即使启用了该选项，也继续使用共享 "
"`FixedRouter`。"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:41
msgid ""
"**The leaf execution boundary is already used by ordinary Fixed and "
"RouteWise.** Existing configurations use these paths without enabling "
"composition:"
msgstr "**普通 Fixed 和 RouteWise 已经使用叶子执行边界**：现有配置无需启用组合，就会走以下路径："

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:49
msgid ""
"Both routers can select from local and cloud endpoints in the same "
"model's route. `hybrid_composition` enables the additional `HybridRouter`"
" layer that plans across separate local/cloud pools; it is not required "
"to use either the leaf boundary or a mixed candidate pool."
msgstr ""
"这两个 router 都可以在同一模型的本地和云端 endpoint 之间选择。`hybrid_composition` 启用额外的 "
"`HybridRouter` 层，由它在分开的 local/cloud 池之间规划尝试；使用叶子执行边界或混合候选池都不需要开启这个选项。"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:54
msgid "Leaves, pools, and dispatch instructions"
msgstr "叶子、池与派发指令"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:56
msgid ""
"`LeafBackend` uses the adapter's call signature and directly forwards its"
" chat call or stream iterator. It does not implement the router-shaped "
"`RoutingBackend` protocol. Pool wrappers such as `TreeBackend` implement "
"that protocol and forward requests to a scoped router."
msgstr ""
"`LeafBackend` 使用 adapter 的调用签名，直接转发普通聊天调用或返回流式迭代器。它不实现采用 router 调用形状的 "
"`RoutingBackend` 协议。`TreeBackend` 等池包装实现该协议，并把请求转发给范围受限的 router。"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:61
msgid ""
"For composed dispatch, `HybridRouter` uses two explicit instructions "
"(`apps/backend/routing/dispatch.py`) to state what a pool may do:"
msgstr ""
"在组合派发中，`HybridRouter` "
"使用两种显式指令（`apps/backend/routing/dispatch.py`）声明池获得的权限："

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md
msgid "Instruction"
msgstr "指令"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md
msgid "Permission"
msgstr "权限"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md
msgid "Pool behavior"
msgstr "池的行为"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md
msgid "`ExecuteEndpoint(binding)`"
msgstr "`ExecuteEndpoint(binding)`"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md
msgid "Execute exactly the bound endpoint."
msgstr "精确执行绑定的 endpoint。"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md
msgid ""
"`TreeBackend` accepts a binding within its model and endpoint scope. The "
"child router admits that target and executes it through a leaf, with re-"
"selection and fallback disabled."
msgstr ""
"`TreeBackend` 接受处于其模型和 endpoint 范围内的 binding。子 router "
"对该目标做准入检查，再通过叶子执行；不得重新选择或 fallback 到其他 endpoint。"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md
msgid "`DelegatePool(pool_id)`"
msgstr "`DelegatePool(pool_id)`"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md
msgid "Select inside the named pool."
msgstr "在指定池内选择。"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md
msgid ""
"`TreeBackend` delegates selection, admission, retries, and hedging to its"
" scoped router."
msgstr "`TreeBackend` 将选择、准入、重试和 hedging 委托给其范围受限的 router。"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:69
msgid ""
"An exact dispatch can therefore pass through a child router for "
"admission; the instruction limits that router to the bound endpoint. "
"`check_dispatch()` and the pool's request validation reject a wrong pool,"
" an excluded model, or an out-of-scope binding before upstream I/O. Such "
"composition errors propagate without fallback or a provider failure "
"sample. A leaf has no pool-selection capability and cannot carry out "
"`DelegatePool`."
msgstr ""
"因此，精确派发仍可以经过子 router 完成准入；指令把该 router 限制在绑定的 endpoint "
"上。`check_dispatch()` 与池的请求校验会在上游 I/O 之前拒绝错误的池、范围外的模型或越界 "
"binding。这类组合错误直接传播，不触发 fallback，也不产生 provider 失败样本。叶子没有池内选择能力，无法执行 "
"`DelegatePool`。"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:76
msgid ""
"`EndpointBinding` carries the endpoint id, the model, the pool, a "
"diagnostic route-table `generation`, and **the adapter itself**. Holding "
"the adapter is the point: execution does not look the target up a second "
"time, so an admin route edit cannot redirect a request that is already in"
" flight. Binding and leaf construction both reject an inconsistent "
"endpoint identity, and a leaf refuses a composite executor that reports "
"outcomes for several endpoints at once. Each hedge leg gets its own leaf."
" If a RouteWise candidate has been replaced by a different adapter object"
" for the same endpoint, RouteWise rejects the old binding before "
"reserving capacity: admission and execution must use the same adapter. "
"`generation` is diagnostic only; it does not decide whether a binding is "
"stale."
msgstr ""
"`EndpointBinding` 携带 endpoint id、模型、池、用于诊断的路由表 `generation`，以及 **adapter "
"本身**。保留 adapter 引用意味着执行时无需再次查找目标，所以管理员修改路由不会把在途请求重定向到其他 adapter。构造 "
"binding 和叶子时都会拒绝不一致的 endpoint 身份；叶子也会拒绝同时报告多个 endpoint 结果的组合执行器。每条 hedge "
"支路各有一个叶子。若 RouteWise 的同一 endpoint 候选已被替换为另一个 adapter 对象，RouteWise "
"会在预留容量前拒绝旧 binding：准入与执行必须使用同一个 adapter。`generation` 仅用于诊断，不决定 binding "
"是否过期。"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:88
msgid ""
"**Accounting stays with the owning router.** Selection, the admission "
"claim, the prefill lease, retry and hedge bookkeeping, `_routing` "
"metadata, and the feedback handed to `record_observation()` all stay with"
" the router that chose the endpoint. A leaf adds no second copy of this "
"state or accounting."
msgstr ""
"**记账留在负责该次尝试的 router 中**：选择、准入凭据、prefill 租约、重试与 hedge 记录、`_routing` "
"元数据，以及交给 `record_observation()` 的反馈，都由选中 endpoint 的 router "
"管理。叶子不另外保存或重复执行这些状态管理与记账。"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:93
msgid ""
"**Pool scopes constrain selection and fallback.** `LocalBackend` and "
"`FixedCloudBackend` enforce model grants and narrow "
"`RoutingRequestOptions.endpoint_scope` before forwarding to the shared "
"router. `RouteWiseCloudBackend` also binds a `RouteScopeView` "
"(`route_scope.py`), keeping the child router's candidate selection, "
"retries, hedge legs, and active probes inside its cloud range. Provider "
"labels are expanded to canonical endpoint ids within the requested model "
"before scopes are compared. A caller's scope can narrow the pool's grant;"
" an empty intersection is refused, never treated as unrestricted access."
msgstr ""
"**池的范围同时约束选择与 fallback**：`LocalBackend` 和 `FixedCloudBackend` "
"校验模型权限，并在转发给共享 router 之前收窄 "
"`RoutingRequestOptions.endpoint_scope`。`RouteWiseCloudBackend` 还会绑定 "
"`RouteScopeView`（`route_scope.py`），把子 router 的候选选择、重试、hedge 支路和主动探测限制在其 "
"cloud 范围内。比较范围前，provider 标签会在请求模型内展开成 canonical endpoint "
"id。调用方可以进一步收窄池授予的范围；交集为空时拒绝派发，不会解释为不受限制的访问。"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:102
msgid ""
"**Requests keep the router API.** Calls use `chat_completion()` or "
"`stream_chat_completion()` with `routing_options`. For each composed "
"attempt, `dispatch_for_attempt()` constructs the instruction; the "
"resolved binding, scope, and target/fallback controls travel through "
"`RoutingRequestOptions` to the child router. A preferred endpoint allows "
"selection of another candidate unless `require_target` is set. "
"`allow_fallback` controls retries after an executed attempt fails."
msgstr ""
"**请求沿用 router API**：调用仍使用 `chat_completion()` 或 "
"`stream_chat_completion()`，并携带 "
"`routing_options`。对每次组合尝试，`dispatch_for_attempt()` 构造指令；解析出的 "
"binding、scope、目标与 fallback 控制字段通过 `RoutingRequestOptions` 传给子 "
"router。除非设置了 `require_target`，偏好 endpoint 允许 router "
"改选其他候选。`allow_fallback` 控制已经执行的尝试失败后能否重试。"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:110
msgid ""
"**Admission refusal does not report an upstream failure.** A configured "
"pool with no available capacity can raise `TargetUnavailableError`. "
"`HybridRouter` then tries the next permitted attempt; a successful "
"fallback is returned normally. If all attempts are refused without "
"reaching an upstream, the final refusal maps to **503**. A streaming "
"response whose headers have already been sent carries code **503** in its"
" SSE error instead of changing the HTTP status. If upstream attempts did "
"fail, the router's error-selection rules determine the final error."
msgstr ""
"**准入拒绝不记为上游失败**：已配置的池在没有可用容量时可以抛出 `TargetUnavailableError`。`HybridRouter`"
" 随后尝试下一个获准的候选；fallback 成功时正常返回成功响应。如果所有尝试都在到达上游前被拒绝，最终的拒绝会映射为 "
"**503**。若流式响应已经发送 HTTP 头，则在 SSE 错误中携带 **503** 错误码，而不是修改 HTTP "
"状态。若确实有上游执行失败，则由 router 的错误选择规则决定最终错误。"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:119
msgid "Composition is opt-in per model, and off by default:"
msgstr "组合按模型选择性启用，默认关闭："

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:127
msgid ""
"Its affinity updates, its re-selection after a rejected primary claim, "
"and its fallback circuit timing are not yet proven equivalent to the "
"original `Fixed` loop, so the default entry point stays the shared "
"`FixedRouter` until they are; see "
"[#1457](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/issues/1457). "
"Pins from the HTTP API and the admin playground keep using the shared "
"`FixedRouter` regardless."
msgstr ""
"它的亲和更新、首选 claim 被拒后的重新选路，以及回退时的熔断器判断时机，都还没有被证明与原 `Fixed` "
"循环等价；在证明之前，默认入口仍然是共享的 `FixedRouter`。见 "
"[#1457](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/issues/1457)。来自 "
"HTTP API 和管理端 playground 的 pin 无论如何都继续使用共享的 `FixedRouter`。"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:134
msgid ""
"Candidate scopes do not divide physical capacity. Each `RouteWiseRouter` "
"still owns its resource managers; sharing a constrained pool across "
"independent instances and rejecting unsupported duplicate-pool "
"configurations remain deferred to the same issue."
msgstr ""
"候选范围不会把物理容量分成独立的份额。每个 `RouteWiseRouter` 仍持有自己的资源 "
"manager；跨独立实例共享受限池，以及拒绝不受支持的重复池配置，均由同一个 issue 跟踪后续实现。"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:139
msgid "Router types and execution boundaries"
msgstr "Router 类型与执行边界"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:141
msgid ""
"Routing also has a composition implementation, `HybridRouter` "
"(`apps/backend/routing/hybrid.py`), which plans across a local and a "
"cloud pool and delegates each attempt to a `TreeBackend`. It is not a "
"third `router:` value: a `router: fixed` model opts in with "
"`router_params.hybrid_composition: true`, and composition is built only "
"when both local and cloud candidates exist. Every other `fixed` model "
"keeps the shared `FixedRouter`, and `routewise` models keep their own "
"entry point and full candidate pool. The ordinary Fixed and RouteWise "
"paths already execute through `LeafBackend`; enabling composition is a "
"separate choice."
msgstr ""
"路由层还提供组合实现 `HybridRouter`（`apps/backend/routing/hybrid.py`），它在 local 与 "
"cloud 两个池之间规划尝试，并把每次尝试委托给一个 `TreeBackend`。它不是第三种 `router:` 配置值：`router: "
"fixed` 模型通过 `router_params.hybrid_composition: true` 显式启用，而且只有同时存在 local "
"和 cloud 候选时才构建组合。其余 `fixed` 模型继续使用共享 `FixedRouter`，`routewise` "
"模型继续使用自己的入口和完整候选池。普通 Fixed 和 RouteWise 路径已经通过 `LeafBackend` "
"执行；是否启用组合是另一项选择。"

#: ../developer/routing-internals.md:151
msgid ""
"The pool side exists so that one algorithm can own admission for a domain"
" while a different algorithm owns selection inside it, with neither one "
"enumerating the other's endpoints."
msgstr "池这一层存在的意义在于：一个算法可以负责某个域的准入，另一个算法负责该域内部的选择，而两者都不必枚举对方的端点。"

