msgid ""
"The diagrams below adapt the [composable routing "
"design](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/blob/dev/docs/agents/specs/2026-09-14"
"-composable-hybrid-routing-design.zh.md) into a map of the current "
"implementation and its planned extensions. The first shows type "
"relationships; the following three show request paths. A dashed box or "
"edge marks something that does not exist yet."
msgstr ""
"下面的图根据[可组合路由设计](https://github.com/HarvardMadSys/hybridInference/blob/dev/docs/agents/specs/2026-09-14"
"-composable-hybrid-routing-"
"design.zh.md)整理，画出当前实现及其计划中的扩展。第一张是类型关系图，后面三张是请求路径图。虚线方框或虚线连线表示尚未实现的部分。"

